' wattleflow.puml — shared wattleflow diagram style (palette, frame, skinparams). Use: !include requirements/styles/wattleflow.puml (path from the workspace root documentation/)
<style>
frame {
  LineColor #e8b924
  LineThickness 1
  BackgroundColor transparent
}
